# The boss under the block of testdata/topo/boss.tlspr: the circle at its
# foot, which the Boolean made and no entity draws, is one edge of four
# pieces. The mouse picks it from below, where the block doesn't hide
# it, on a piece whose name is not the lowest, and the fillet names the
# edge by its lowest piece all the same; the same as path_fillet_rim.go
# makes (TestPathEquivalence/fillet_rim).
file $testdata/topo/boss.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view under
menu View|Zoom To Fit
click-edge the edge between face 2 of g005-boss and bottom face of g003-block
menu Features|Fillet Edges
